> Module Ptc_allowed

> Using Types
> Using Params_2024 as P

# Premium tax credit, part 2: Forms 1095-A, annual and monthly PTC allowed (Form 8962 lines 9 to 25)

Direct File ("DF" below) module `ptc.xml`
(`../direct-file/direct-file/backend/src/main/resources/tax/ptc.xml`, 9,760
lines): the `/1095As` collection (lines 1966 to 6453), the eligibility gates
(`/hasPtcQualifyingPlan` line 489, `/potentiallyApplicableTaxPayer` line
1781), the annual path (`/ptcCanReportAnnualTotals` line 6456 to
`/annualPtcAllowed` line 6593), the monthly path (`/monthlyPtcPremiumFor<Month>`
line 6893 to `/monthlyAptcPremiumFor<Month>` line 8405), the totals
`/totalPtcAmountAllowed` (line 8705, Form 8962 line 24) and
`/totalAptcAmountTaken` (line 8972, line 25), and the PTC knockouts of
`flow.xml` lines 96 to 103. Issue #33, scope.md section 6.6. Law: 26 U.S.C.
§ 36B(b), (c) (`sources/statute/irc-36B.html`), 26 CFR 1.36B-2 and 1.36B-3
(`sources/regs/cfr-1.36B-2.xml`, `cfr-1.36B-3.xml`), Form 8962 (2024)
(`sources/forms-instructions/f8962--2024.pdf` p 1) and its instructions
(`sources/forms-instructions/i8962--2024.pdf`: married taxpayers and
dependents p 6 to 7, line 10 p 12 to 13, line 11 p 13 to 14, lines 12 to 23
p 14 to 15, lines 24 and 25 p 15). Tests: `catala/tests/test_ptc_allowed.catala_en`.
Oracle comparison: `difftest/mappings/ptc_allowed.mjs` through the wrapper
`catala/tests/difftest_ptc_allowed.catala_en`.

## What this module computes, and how it plugs in

- Inputs from part 1 (`Ptc_family.PtcFamily`, #32):
  `household_income_as_percent` (line 5), `ptc_annual_contribution_amount`
  (line 8a) and `ptc_monthly_contribution_amount` (line 8b).
- Outputs for part 3 (#34): `total_ptc_amount_allowed` (Form 8962 line 24),
  `total_aptc_amount_taken` (line 25), `needs_to_file_form8962`,
  `has_advanced_ptc`, `qualified_for_ptc` and `unsupported`. Part 3 computes
  the net PTC (line 26) and the repayment (lines 27 to 29).
- One 1095-A is a `Form1095A` with the twelve monthly amounts of Form 1095-A
  Part III, columns A, B and C, as three month-indexed lists (January first).
  The per-form facts are computed by the scope `Form1095ACalculation`, applied
  to each form; its twelve months are rows of a `Form1095AMonth` list. Form
  8962 lines 12 to 23 are rows of a `PtcMonth` list.
- The inputs are complete (CONVENTIONS section 3). A DF writable that DF only
  reads under a condition (a `Switch` with no default) is an input here and
  the condition is reproduced as a rule. An answer DF never asks is `false`.
- OUT OF SCOPE (knocked out, see the last section): allocation of policy
  amounts with another taxpayer (Form 8962 line 9, Part IV), the alternative
  calculation for year of marriage (Part V), QSEHRA (line 11(e) note),
  employer-sponsored plans, dependents required to file, immigration-status
  exceptions and more than one Form 1095-A.

## Declarations

```catala-metadata
## One Form 1095-A (Health Insurance Marketplace Statement), as entered in
## Direct File. DF: ptc.xml /1095As/*. Month lists hold twelve amounts,
## January first; a month DF does not ask is $0.
declaration structure Form1095A:
  # DF: /1095As/*/writablePolicyStartDate (Form 1095-A line 13 column B)
  data writable_policy_start_date content date
  # DF: /1095As/*/writablePolicyEndDate (Form 1095-A line 14 column C)
  data writable_policy_end_date content date
  # DF: /1095As/*/writableSpecialPolicyModificationInStartingMonth (birth,
  # adoption, placement for adoption or foster care in the starting month)
  data writable_special_policy_modification_in_starting_month content boolean
  # DF: /1095As/*/writableHasPolicyDateException
  data writable_has_policy_date_exception content boolean
  # DF: /1095As/*/hasCoverageMonths
  data has_coverage_months content boolean
  # DF: /1095As/*/coverageMonths (MultiEnum jan..dec as month numbers 1..12)
  data coverage_months content list of integer
  # DF: /1095As/*/writablePremiumsOrSlcspChange
  data writable_premiums_or_slcsp_change content boolean
  # DF: /1095As/*/hasChangeInCircumstance
  data has_change_in_circumstance content boolean
  # Form 1095-A line 33 column A. DF: /1095As/*/writablePtcAnnualPremium
  data writable_ptc_annual_premium content money
  # Form 1095-A line 33 column B. DF: /1095As/*/writableSlcspAnnualPremium
  data writable_slcsp_annual_premium content money
  # Form 1095-A line 33 column C. DF: /1095As/*/writableAptcAnnualAmount
  data writable_aptc_annual_amount content money
  # Form 1095-A lines 21 to 32 column A. DF: /1095As/*/writablePtcMonthlyPremium<Month>
  data writable_ptc_monthly_premium content list of money
  # Form 1095-A lines 21 to 32 column B. DF: /1095As/*/writablePtcMonthlySlcspPremium<Month>
  data writable_ptc_monthly_slcsp_premium content list of money
  # Form 1095-A lines 21 to 32 column C. DF: /1095As/*/writablePtcMonthlyAptcPremium<Month>
  data writable_ptc_monthly_aptc_premium content list of money

## One month of one Form 1095-A, as DF reads it.
declaration structure Form1095AMonth:
  # 1 (January) to 12 (December)
  data month_number content integer
  # DF: /1095As/*/policyIsActiveIn<Month>
  data policy_is_active content boolean
  # DF: /1095As/*/has<Month>CoverageMonth
  data is_coverage_month content boolean
  # DF: /1095As/*/ptcMonthlyPremium<Month> (column A)
  data premium content money
  # DF: /1095As/*/ptcMonthlySlcspPremium<Month> (column B)
  data slcsp_premium content money
  # DF: /1095As/*/ptcMonthlyAptcPremium<Month> (column C)
  data aptc content money

## One of Form 8962 lines 12 to 23 (columns (a) to (f)).
declaration structure PtcMonth:
  # 1 (January, line 12) to 12 (December, line 23)
  data month_number content integer
  # DF: /hasActive1095APolicyIn<Month>
  data has_active_policy content boolean
  # (a) DF: /monthlyPtcPremiumFor<Month>
  data enrollment_premium content money
  # (b) DF: /monthlyPtcSlcspPremiumFor<Month>
  data slcsp_premium content money
  # (c) DF: /monthlyPtcContributionAmountFor<Month>
  data contribution_amount content money
  # (d) DF: /monthlyPtcMaxPremiumAssitanceFor<Month> (sic)
  data max_premium_assistance content money
  # (e) DF: /monthlyPtcAllowedFor<Month>
  data ptc_allowed content money
  # (f) DF: /monthlyAptcPremiumFor<Month>
  data advance_payment content money

## The amount for month `month_number` (1 to 12) of a twelve-amount list; $0 if
## the list is shorter.
declaration month_amount content money
  depends on
    amounts content list of money,
    month_number content integer
  equals
    match (List.nth_element of amounts, month_number) with pattern
    -- Present content a: a
    -- Absent: $0

declaration scope Form1095ACalculation:
  input form content Form1095A
  # DF: ptc.xml /potentiallyApplicableTaxPayer (scope PtcAllowed)
  input potentially_applicable_tax_payer condition
  # DF: ptc.xml /hasAdvancedPtc (scope PtcAllowed)
  input has_advanced_ptc condition

  internal start_month content integer
  internal start_day content integer
  internal end_month content integer
  # DF: /1095As/*/hasPolicyDateException
  output has_policy_date_exception condition
  # DF: /1095As/*/eligibleForCoverageMonths
  output eligible_for_coverage_months condition
  # DF: /1095As/*/hasPolicyForAllMonths
  output has_policy_for_all_months condition
  # The coverage months (1 to 12)
  output coverage_month_numbers content list of integer
  # The twelve months, January first
  output months content list of Form1095AMonth
  # DF: /1095As/*/numberOfCoverageMonths
  output number_of_coverage_months content integer
  # DF: /1095As/*/hasZeroCoverageMonths
  output has_zero_coverage_months condition
  # DF: /1095As/*/hasAtLeastOneCoverageMonth
  output has_at_least_one_coverage_month condition
  # DF: /1095As/*/premiumsOrSlcspChange is asked (its Switch condition)
  internal premiums_or_slcsp_change_is_asked condition
  # DF: /1095As/*/ptcAnnualPremium is complete
  output ptc_annual_premium_is_known condition
  # DF: /1095As/*/noChangesAnd12MonthPolicy
  output no_changes_and12_month_policy condition
  # DF: /1095As/*/aptcAnnualAmount is complete
  output aptc_annual_amount_is_known condition
  # DF: /1095As/*/aptcAnnualAmount
  output aptc_annual_amount content money
  # DF: /1095As/*/hasCoverageMonthsOrAptc
  output has_coverage_months_or_aptc condition
  # This form allows Form 8962 line 11 (annual totals); DF: the filter of
  # /ptcCanReportAnnualTotals
  output can_report_annual_totals condition
  # Line 11 column (a) contribution of this form (DF /1095As/*/ptcAnnualPremium, $0 if unknown)
  output annual_premium content money
  # Line 11 column (b) contribution of this form (DF /1095As/*/slcspAnnualPremium, $0 if unknown)
  output annual_slcsp_premium content money

declaration scope PtcAllowed:
